WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.120
Like something from a fairy tale

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.360
Proof that the story has reached its end

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.180
From that boundless journey

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.890
Extracting a small snippet of a story

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.370
It was once upon this land

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.540
That evil once cast its shadow

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.080
And with the hero who defeated it

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.330
A brief journey together

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.030
The story came to an end

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.270
And the hero fell into an eternal slumber

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:37.070
Leaving behind only the ordinary everyday.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.760
To endure forever in this world

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:41.190
Time flows on without mercy

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.410
And makes people forget

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.130
Even the traces that once existed there

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:47.990
Slowly rust away

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:49.570
And yet, your

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.030
Words, wishes, and courage

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.220
Even now

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.270
they remain vivid within my heart

00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:59.830
I thought I had only chosen the same path

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.150
That should have been all

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:03.550
So when did it happen That I began To want to know more

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:08.050
The reason these tears fall down my face

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:09.200
To want to know more

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.270
Even now

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.670
If I follow the journey we walked together

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:15.990
Even if you are no longer there

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.980
I am sure I will find it

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:29.650
The story continues

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:31.940
As I set out on a journey alone

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.290
In the towns I stop in

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.290
The you that remains in people’s memories

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.430
Is still as kind as ever

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.750
Always trying to look cool

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.420
The symbols you left everywhere

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.060
Are proof of the peace you won

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:46.020
Even those

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.290
Someday in the future

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.840
Were left behind so that  I would not be alone

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.000
So I could remember that journey

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.940
The marks left behind

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.440
Like a fairy tale

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.900
Proof that the story has ended

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.280
The encounter that changed me

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.410
A journey that was only one percent of my life

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:16.100
Someday your courage

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.240
Will be carried away by the wind

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.720
And even if it disappears from everyone’s memory

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:23.500
I will carry it into the future

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:24.740
The day I took your hand

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:26.460
Everything began from there

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:27.580
Those trivial little moments

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.070
That made me suddenly laugh

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:34.620
Still shine brightly even now

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.700
I want to know

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:36.800
Even now

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.280
Because whenever I look back

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:42.540
You are always there

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:47.570
Smiling gently at me

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.890
And so a new journey begins

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.670
Here on the land you protected to the very end

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:05.370
Together with the lives that begin to sprout

